{"sha": "eff575b8ae5c738f1ecb0a0d38a131fd19d96452c4b4052e77652797d67598e5", "body": ["\\begin{example}[单摆]\\label{ex:b1:newton-dynamics:pendulum}", "\\index{单摆}", "质量为 $m$ 的小球系于长为 $\\ell$ 的细绳上，细绳与竖直向下方向的夹角为 $\\theta$。", "悬点处取极坐标，$\\vect a =", "-\\ell\\dot\\theta^2\\,\\vect e_r + \\ell\\ddot\\theta\\,\\vect e_\\theta$；受力为", "重力 $mg(\\cos\\theta\\,\\vect e_r - \\sin\\theta\\,\\vect e_\\theta)$ 与", "张力 $-T\\vect e_r$。沿 $\\vect e_\\theta$ 方向：$m\\ell\\ddot\\theta =", "-mg\\sin\\theta$，", "\\[", "\\ddot\\theta + \\frac{g}{\\ell}\\sin\\theta = 0 ,", "\\]", "当角度很小（$\\sin\\theta \\approx \\theta$）时，上式即为谐振动方程，", "其中 $\\omega_0 = \\sqrt{g/\\ell}$，周期 $T_0 = 2\\pi\\sqrt{\\ell/g}$，", "这里的 $k = 2\\pi$ 正是 \\cref{ex:b1:units-dimensions:pendulum} 所未能给出的。", "沿 $\\vect e_r$ 方向：$T = mg\\cos\\theta + m\\ell\\dot\\theta^2$ ---", "细绳在最低点拉力最大，此处速率也最大。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=1cm, y=1cm]", "  \\draw[thick] (-1,3.2) -- (1,3.2); \\fill[pattern=north east lines] (-1,3.2) rectangle (1,3.45);", "  \\fill (0,3.2) circle (1.2pt);", "  \\draw[dashed] (0,3.2) -- (0,0.2);", "  \\coordinate (M) at ($(0,3.2)+(-65:2.8)$);", "  \\draw[thick] (0,3.2) -- (M);", "  \\fill[omDef] (M) circle (3pt); \\node[below right] at (M) {$m$};", "  \\draw (0,2.3) arc (-90:-65:0.9); \\node at (0.25,2.05) {$\\theta$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (M) -- ++(0,-1.3) node[below] {$m\\vect g$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, very thick] (M) -- ++(115:1.6) node[pos=0.55, left, xshift=-2pt] {$\\vect T$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omProp, thick] (M) -- ++(-65:0.9) node[right] {$\\vect e_r$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omProp, thick] (M) -- ++(25:0.9) node[right] {$\\vect e_\\theta$};", "  \\draw[omDef!40] ($(0,3.2)+(-110:2.8)$) arc (-110:-60:2.8);", "\\end{tikzpicture}\\qquad", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, axis x line=bottom, width=7.2cm, height=4.8cm, xlabel={$t/\\tau$}, ylabel={$v/v_\\infty$},", "    xmin=0, xmax=5, ymin=0, ymax=1.2, ytick={0.5,1}, xtick={1,2,3,4,5}]", "  \\addplot[omDef, thick, domain=0:5, samples=100] {1 - exp(-x)};", "  \\addplot[omThm, thick, domain=0:5, samples=100] {tanh(x)};", "  \\addplot[omExo, dashed, domain=0:5, samples=2] {1};", "  \\node[omDef, font=\\footnotesize] at (axis cs:3.6,0.8) {线性阻力};", "  \\node[omThm, font=\\footnotesize] at (axis cs:1.2,1.1) {二次阻力};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 左图：单摆、它所受的两个力，以及用来投影牛顿定律的极坐标基；", "右图：物体自静止下落，受重力与阻力作用，速率趋近终端", "速度 $v_\\infty$：线性阻力时按指数规律趋近，", "其时间尺度 $\\tau = m/\\alpha$；二次阻力时为双曲正切，", "其时间尺度 $\\tau = v_\\infty/g$。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[有阻力的下落；终端速度]\\label{prop:b1:newton-dynamics:terminal}", "\\index{终端速度}", "质量为 $m$ 的物体自静止下落，受重力与阻力作用，", "最终达到两力平衡时的\\emph{终端速度}。线性阻力情形：", "$m\\dot v = mg - \\alpha v$，$v = v_\\infty(1 - \\eu^{-t/\\tau})$，其中", "$v_\\infty = mg/\\alpha$，$\\tau = m/\\alpha$。二次阻力情形：$m\\dot v = mg -", "\\tfrac12\\rho C_xSv^2$，$v = v_\\infty\\tanh(t/\\tau)$，其中", "\\[", "v_\\infty = \\sqrt{\\frac{2mg}{\\rho C_xS}}, \\qquad \\tau = \\frac{v_\\infty}{g} .", "\\]", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "线性情形为一阶方程，$\\tau\\dot v + v = v_\\infty$", "（见\\cref{thm:b1:transient-regimes:firstorder}）。二次情形中，令", "$u = v/v_\\infty$，$\\dot u = (1 - u^2)/\\tau$；分离变量，", "$\\int\\dd u/(1 - u^2) = \\operatorname{artanh}u = t/\\tau$（其中有理", "分式 $1/(1 - u^2) = \\tfrac12[1/(1 - u) + 1/(1 + u)]$ 的积分为", "$\\tfrac12\\ln\\frac{1 + u}{1 - u}$），于是 $u = \\tanh(t/\\tau)$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[两种终端速度]\\label{ex:b1:newton-dynamics:terminal}", "一名跳伞者，$m = \\qty{80}{kg}$，俯卧姿势，$C_xS \\approx \\qty{0.8}{m^2}$", "在空气中（$\\rho = \\qty{1.2}{kg/m^3}$）：$v_\\infty = \\sqrt{2 \\times 785/(1.2", "\\times 0.8)} = \\qty{40}{m/s}$，达到（至 $90\\%$）所需时间约为 $1.5\\tau =", "\\qty{6}{s}$。一颗雾滴，$r = \\qty{10}{\\micro m}$，处于斯托克斯区", "（$\\eta_{\\text{空气}} = \\qty{1.8e-5}{Pa.s}$）：$v_\\infty = mg/6\\pi\\eta r =", "\\qty{1.2}{cm/s}$ --- 这正是雾能悬浮在空中的原因。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{圆周上的运动：约束力}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[向心条件]\\label{prop:b1:newton-dynamics:centripetal}", "\\index{向心力}", "质点在半径为 $R$ 的圆周上以速率 $v$ 运动时，", "其所受合力须提供一个指向圆心的分量 $mv^2/R$。", "无论由何种力提供（绳的张力、摩擦力、", "弯道路面的法向力、重力），它都决定了运动可能的", "最大速率或最小速率。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "由牛顿第二定律及弗勒内加速度，", "$\\sum\\vect F$ 的法向分量等于 $mv^2/\\rho$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[三种圆周]\\label{ex:b1:newton-dynamics:circles}", "\\emph{水平弯道}：摩擦力须提供 $mv^2/R \\leq \\mu_sN = \\mu_smg$，", "故 $v \\leq \\sqrt{\\mu_sgR}$：\\qty{20}{m/s}（$R = \\qty{50}{m}$，", "$\\mu_s = 0.8$）。\\emph{倾斜弯道}，倾角为 $\\beta$，无摩擦：", "法向力 $\\vect N$ 垂直于路面；竖直方向 $N\\cos\\beta = mg$，", "水平方向 $N\\sin\\beta = mv^2/R$，故 $v^2 = gR\\tan\\beta$ ---", "这是无需摩擦即可通过弯道的唯一速率。\\emph{竖直圆轨道}：在", "最高点处，$\\vect N$ 竖直向下指向圆心，$N + mg =", "mv^2/R$，而 $N \\geq 0$ 要求 $v \\geq \\sqrt{gR}$：低于此值时，车", "将脱离轨道（见\\cref{pb:b1:point-kinematics:1}，现已得到解释）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[font=\\small, x=1cm, y=1cm]", "  % banked road cross-section", "  \\draw[thick] (0,0) -- (4,1.6);", "  \\fill[pattern=north east lines] (0,0) -- (4,1.6) -- (4,1.4) -- (0,-0.2) -- cycle;", "  \\draw (1.2,0) arc (0:21.8:1.2); \\node at (1.5,0.22) {$\\beta$};", "  \\draw[dashed] (0,0) -- (2,0);", "  \\coordinate (G) at (2.0,1.1);", "  \\begin{scope}[shift={(2.0,0.8)}, rotate=21.8]", "    \\draw[thick, fill=omDef!15] (-0.6,0) rectangle (0.6,0.45);", "  \\end{scope}", "  \\fill (G) circle (1.4pt);", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, very thick] (G) -- ++(0,-1.5) node[below] {$m\\vect g$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omDef, very thick] (G) -- ++(111.8:1.75) node[above] {$\\vect N$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omProp, very thick] (G) -- ++(-0.9,0) node[left] {$m\\vect a = \\dfrac{mv^2}{R}$};", "  \\node[right, font=\\footnotesize] at (4.1,1.6) {指向外侧};", "  \\node[left, font=\\footnotesize] at (-0.1,0) {弯道圆心};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", ""]}